1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I love all dogs.

2
00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:02,120
I do.

3
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:05,240
But what is it with people buying designer dogs?

4
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:06,580
People want to be trendy.

5
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:08,260
They want a dog that fits the aesthetic.

6
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:09,860
But you know what doesn't fit the aesthetic?

7
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:11,720
Buying dogs who can't breathe.

8
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:13,720
You've heard of breathing impaired breeds, right?

9
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:17,840
Well, these are dogs who have been unnaturally bred and inbred to have flattened faces,

10
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:19,620
making it difficult for them to breathe.

11
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:24,880
They also require extensive and expensive medical care just to help them take in air.

12
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:29,180
Why are people spending thousands of dollars on designer dogs who can't breathe?

13
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:32,140
By adopting from a shelter and not supporting breeders,

14
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:36,160
you can send the message that breeding dogs to suffer is not the vibe.

15
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:39,340
Plus, when you adopt, you can find an awesome mutt like Jordy.

16
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:40,240
Hi, Jordy!

17
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:45,700
You can help stop the demand for designer and breathing impaired dogs by adopting your next dog

18
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:49,360
and finding a companion almost as trendy as Jordy.

19
00:00:49,420 --> 00:00:50,200
Look at that mohawk.

20
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:53,160
For more ways to help animals, visit PETA.org.

